    - Pick N segments (3-4). For each, choose a distinct color (not 0 or wall_color).
    - Assign distinct distances from wall, sorted ascending, each >= 2, with gaps >= 2.
    - Assign segment lengths increasing with distance (nearer <= farther), range [2, min(grid_parallel_dim-2, 9)].
    - Place segments along the wall axis ensuring >= 1 overlapping pair (span overlap along wall).
    - Build output by painting projection strips from farthest to nearest (farther first, nearer overwrites).
    - Derive input by erasing all projection fill, keeping only original 1-cell segments and wall bar.
